    "product_faq_iXcLnC": {
      "type": "product-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_Fq7LBp": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product"
          }
        },
        "tab_content_683zbz": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Does this charge multiple Apple devices simultaneously?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Absolutely! It is specifically designed to charge 3 Apple devices simultaneously:<br/>Built-in retractable USB-C cable for iPhone/iPad<br/>Additional USB-C port (30W output)<br/>Magnetic Apple Watch charger (5W output)<br/>This means you can charge your iPhone, iPad, and Apple Watch all at the same time. It's compatible with iPhone 17/16/15 series, all Apple Watch models (including Ultra series), AirPods, and iPads - making it the perfect all-in-one solution for your Apple ecosystem.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_fjWWzA": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Does the built-in cable prevent tangling?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes. The 2.13ft retractable cable stretches when you need it and snaps back magnetically when not in use, keeping your bag clutter-free. The keychain design also allows easy carrying on your backpack or wrist.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_Wrb3qd": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>What's the full charging time for iPhone?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>It can charge your iPhone to 60% in just 30 minutes with its 30W fast charging capability. For a complete charge from 0% to 100%, it typically takes about 1.5-2 hours depending on your specific iPhone model. The newer iPhone models (15 Pro Max) may take slightly longer for a full charge due to their larger battery capacity.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_KQRxtY": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Does the cable tangle or get damaged easily?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>No, It is specifically designed to eliminate cable tangling and damage issues! The built-in retractable cable features a magnetic snap-back mechanism that keeps it neat and organized - it extends when you need it and retracts automatically when you don't. This eliminates the common problem of cables getting twisted or knotted in your bag. For durability, the cable is engineered to withstand 3,000+ pulls without loosening, and the entire power bank undergoes extensive aging tests before shipment to ensure reliable performance.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_NVT3iN": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Is this portable charger safe to use?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes. The charger is UL-certified and features smart protection chips that safeguard your devices from overcharging, overcurrent, over-voltage, and short circuits, ensuring safe everyday use.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_rjgjrP": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Can I bring this power bank on a plane?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Absolutely. With 12000mAh capacity and a compact design (5.27 × 2.55 × 0.98 inches), it meets airline carry-on regulations, making it safe for flights.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        }
      },
